  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Justice Program (2017-2021)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands Justice Program works with communities in Solomon Islands to have greater access to a credible justice system that supports the rule of law. The Justice Program&#x2019;s outcomes include: justice sector agencies are increasingly capable of delivering core services; legislation is supported by sound policy development, is clearly written and well understood; access to justice for Solomon Islanders is improved; and good practice in leadership, decision making, public sector management and community engagement is increasingly demonstrated in the justice sector. The total value of this investment is $32.7 million over 4 financial years, starting 2017-18.</narrative>
  </description>
